SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

The MIT terms above are unmodified and apply to the source code, Jupyter
notebooks, and documentation in this repository.

They do NOT apply to the challenge data.

The raw challenge data (initial designs, inputs.txt, outputs.txt) is private
and is not distributed in this repository. The derived file
consolidated_observations.csv, together with the result CSVs and submission
strings under pipeline/, is included solely so that the reported results can
be reproduced and inspected. That data remains subject to the academic terms
of the Imperial College Business School Bayesian Optimisation Challenge and
is not licensed for redistribution or reuse.

See DATASHEET_AND_MODEL_CARD.md, Part 1, "Distribution", for the full
statement.
